---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy policy · Facundo Corbalan"
  description="Information on the processing of personal data at facundocorbalan.com."
  lang="en"
  active=""
  esPath="/privacidad/"
  enPath="/en/privacy/"
>
  <section style="padding:64px 0">
    <div class="wrap narrow">
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <article class="prose">
        <p class="muted">
          <strong>Pending review.</strong> This text is a starting point and must be completed with the relevant
          registration details and reviewed before publication.
        </p>

        <h2>Data controller</h2>
        <p>
          Facundo Corbalan, based in Madrid (Spain), contact email
          <a href="mailto:facundo@facundocorbalan.com">facundo@facundocorbalan.com</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Purpose</h2>
        <p>
          The data you submit through the contact form is used solely to answer your enquiry and, where applicable, to
          manage a possible professional relationship. It is not used for unsolicited marketing.
        </p>

        <h2>Legal basis</h2>
        <p>
          Processing is based on your consent, given by ticking the box on the form, and on the legitimate interest of
          responding to professional enquiries.
        </p>

        <h2>Retention</h2>
        <p>
          Data is kept for as long as needed to handle the enquiry and, if a professional relationship begins, for the
          periods required by law.
        </p>

        <h2>Recipients</h2>
        <p>
          Data is stored on the hosting and form-handling services used by this website. It is not shared with third
          parties except where legally required.
        </p>

        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          You may exercise your rights of access, rectification, erasure, objection, restriction and portability by
          writing to <a href="mailto:facundo@facundocorbalan.com">facundo@facundocorbalan.com</a>. You may also lodge a
          complaint with the Spanish Data Protection Agency (AEPD).
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          This website uses no tracking or advertising cookies. Should any analytics tool be added in the future, it
          will be disclosed here.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
